<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Electronic Data reduced.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Electronic Data reduced.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said it downgraded Electronic Data Systems Corp to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- reduced the earnings estimates to $2.30 per share from $2.40 for 1997, and to $2.60 from $2.75 for 1998.</p>
</text>
